<title>USA: Bion Environmental converts debt.</title>
<headline>Bion Environmental converts debt.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bion Environmental Technologies Inc said that effective May 6, it has increased stockholders' equity by $2,856,000 in a transaction that converted and canceled $2,146,000 of existing indebtedness and added $710,000 of real property to its balance sheet.</p>
<p>Bion said the transaction brings it back into a positive shareholders' equity position, eliminates most ongoing debt service payments and provides real assets that will be sold to provide a cash infusion to fund current operations.</p>
</text>
